# In async tests (e.g. tokio) that spawn a (preference)

Standing user preference: In async tests (e.g. tokio) that spawn a server (e.g. axum/hyper), ensure the server task is actively polled before sending external requests; an unpolled server task causes requests to silently time out.

## Conventions
- In async tests (e.g. tokio) that spawn a server (e.g. axum/hyper), ensure the server task is actively polled before sending external requests; an unpolled server task causes requests to silently time out.

